  "decision_date": "10/12/2021",
  "description": "Alteration of the existing flats and single family dwelling house to create four flats with a front infill extension and third floor extension to No.276 and a third floor extension to No.278, with alteration to the rear elevation and rear access to both properties, including the erection of a rear staircase tower and four roof terraces.",
